{"id":"3d38ac8758e3d727","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Filter Completion Carrier","display":"df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier — ZFC Order12 Filter Completion Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier — ZFC Order12 Filter Completion Carrier","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier — ZFC Order12 Filter Completion Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9df1aa443914fe25\" href=\"?note=9df1aa443914fe25\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span> (carrier and order of a poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span> (candidate completion carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S\\)</span> (poset-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9df1aa443914fe25\" href=\"?note=9df1aa443914fe25\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12FilterCompletionCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12FilterCompletionCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}filter\\text{-}completion\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12FilterCompletionCarrier}_S(\\mathcal F,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}filter\\text{-}completion\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12FilterCompletionCarrier}_S(\\mathcal F,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus the carrier contains exactly the nonempty upward-closed, downward-directed filters of the specified poset, rather than arbitrary objects satisfying an untyped subscripted predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"9df1aa443914fe25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"9df1aa443914fe25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S$ (poset-filter predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12FilterCompletionCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}filter\\text{-}completion\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12FilterCompletionCarrier}_S(\\mathcal F,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1254,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2909","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier.md|58-df-zfc-order12-filter-completion-carrier]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9df1aa443914fe25"]}